model t
  tally 2
  on 2025-12-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 §4 item 77 (#201), plan §14, from the planner i77c: the start of the run, so whether the instance is booked or left out depends on the day (s1, 100.00 today); a window crossing the end of the run is already the hole (e1)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input ws: date
input we: date

move early: transfers
  on ws
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move late: transfers
  on we
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-11-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  ws = window(2025-12-30, 2026-01-03) "s"
  we = window(2026-06-28, 2026-07-03) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask s1: bal(konto, 2026-01-31)
ask s2: bal(konto, 2026-01-31)
ask s3: flows(early, 2026-01)
ask s4: count(t in transfers over 2025-12-01 .. 2026-01-31)
ask e1: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)
ask e2_s1: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) with ws = 2025-12-30, we = 2026-06-28

ask e2_s2: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) with ws = 2025-12-30, we = 2026-07-01

ask e2_s3: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) with ws = 2026-01-01, we = 2026-06-28

ask e2_s4: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) with ws = 2026-01-01, we = 2026-07-01
